<div class="widget editor pageStyles narrow" id="divEditora8e2c23d-e7e8-4426-9422-3951eae78e75" data-elementqueryclasses='{"wide-narrow":"min-width:25em"}'>
	    <div class="fr-view">


        <h2 class="subhead1"><span style="font-size: 24px;">Park Features</span></h2><table style="width: 100%; height: 100px; margin: auto; border-width: 1px; border-style: solid;"><colgroup><col style="width: 100.0000%;"></colgroup><tbody><tr><td><ul><li>18-acre Sports park with four full-size synthetic turf soccer and football fields</li><li>ADA accessible playground</li><li>Musical playground and sensory area</li><li>Concession, storage, and restroom buildings</li><li>Walking paths</li><li>Fitness Area with 12 workout equipment stations</li></ul></td></tr></tbody></table><p><br></p><h2 class="subhead1" id="isPasted"><span style="font-size: 24px;">Park Rules &amp; Regulations</span></h2><p>The four full-size synthetic turf soccer and football fields are available for reservations by contacting Fontana&apos;s Community Services Department Athletic Fields Division at (909) 349-6971. These high quality fields will be a wonderful resource for community members to be involved in team sports, increasing community health and personal enrichment experiences. Equipped with sports lighting fixtures for nighttime play and mister stations to beat the heat, the fields are designed for use throughout the year.</p>
    </div>

